{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52136","headline":"四言曲池酺饮座铭 · 于志宁","name":"四言曲池酺饮座铭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泾抽冠筝，源开绶花。\n水随湾曲，树逐风斜。\n始攀幽桂，更折疎麻。\n再欢难遇，聊赏山家。\n（《翰林学士集》）（按：此诗原署「兵部侍郎于志宁」。\n张步云《唐代逸诗辑存》收录本诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于志宁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52136.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52136","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}